' 4+1 logical view - States of a booking (D-BOOKING) · Booking.Status
' Version 1.1 - 2026-11-10
' For: whoever writes the code.
' Documented decision: A booking's state changes only through methods of the Booking entity; the exclusion constraint covers only Confirmed bookings (ADR 0003).
' Not drawn: controllers, HTTP and screens.
@startuml logical-state-booking
!include ../style.puml
title Logical view - states of a booking: Booking.Status

hide empty description
state Confirmed : confirmed\noccupies the slot (bookings_no_overlap)
state CancelledByPlayer : cancelled by the player\nCancelledAt
state CancelledByClub : cancelled by the club\nCancelledAt, CancellationReason
state NoShow : no-show\ndoes not occupy the slot

[*] --> Confirmed : Booking.ForPlayer(…)\n(BookingService, RecurringBookingService)\nBooking.ForCustomer(…)\n(ClubBookingService.CreateAsync)
Confirmed --> CancelledByPlayer : CancelByPlayer(window, now)\n[now < StartsAt − the club's current window]\nBookingCancellationService, under the pitch lock
Confirmed --> CancelledByClub : CancelByClub(reason, now)\n[not started yet]\nClubBookingService.CancelAsync, under the pitch lock
Confirmed --> NoShow : RecordNoShow(now)\n[now ≥ EndsAt]\nClubBookingService.MarkNoShowAsync, under the pitch lock
NoShow --> Confirmed : UndoNoShow()\n[the constraint accepts it; 23P01 → 409 slot_taken]\nClubBookingService.UndoNoShowAsync, under the pitch lock

note right of CancelledByPlayer
  Both cancellations are final:
  no method leaves them.
  The booking is never deleted.
end note

note bottom of Confirmed
  Refusals (the state does not change):
  CancelByPlayer → NotConfirmed (422 booking_not_confirmed),
    OutsideWindow (422 outside_cancellation_window)
  CancelByClub → NotConfirmed (422), AlreadyStarted (422 booking_already_started)
  RecordNoShow → NotConfirmed (422), NotEnded (422 booking_not_ended)
  UndoNoShow → false (422 booking_not_no_show)
end note

@enduml
